# Desolace (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Desolace for a
# Horde character, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Thirty-two are vendor-sold by in-zone vendors
# Horde characters can buy (Super-Seller 680 and Vendor-Tron 1000, both
# neutral; Kireena, Wulan and Muuran, all Horde; the Magram/Gelkis clan
# quartermasters Gorhak and Molkar, who carry no Horde flag); six are mob
# drops with sole droppers spawning only in-zone. Everything else
# Desolace-dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued
# per case in the inventory), quest records carry no reward data so no
# quest-reward recipe ships, and one narrow formula belongs to a
# Badlands-family mob with a single incidental Desolace point (see
# docs/desolace-horde-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestars own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession and every goal is optional; other characters skip it cleanly.
# First Aid has no Desolace source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/desolace-horde-recipes
title Desolace (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns
levels 31-45
zone Desolace
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords desolace, horde, recipes, patterns, companions
coords live
version 1

step Super-Seller 680 - bear, buzzard, wolf, chili and mystery (Cooking)

  zone map 1443

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Super-Seller 680 (40.48, 79.27) sells the recipes; the shop is neutral, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 3734 "Recipe: Big Bear Steak" npc 12246 optional
  buy 4609 "Recipe: Barbecued Buzzard Wing" npc 12246 optional
  buy 12227 "Recipe: Lean Wolf Steak" npc 12246 optional
  buy 12229 "Recipe: Hot Wolf Ribs" npc 12246 optional
  buy 12239 "Recipe: Dragonbreath Chili" npc 12246 optional
  buy 12233 "Recipe: Mystery Stew" npc 12246 optional
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

