step Kireena - stews and silk gloves (Cooking and Tailoring)

  zone map 1443

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Kireena (50.98, 53.55), Horde Trade Goods, sells the recipes; Horde characters buy from their own vendor.
  buy 12232 "Recipe: Carrion Surprise" npc 9636 optional
  buy 12240 "Recipe: Heavy Kodo Stew" npc 9636 optional
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

  when skill Tailoring 1

  buy 7114 "Pattern: Azure Silk Gloves" npc 9636 optional
  note Kireena is the in-zone seller; the only other vendor is out-of-zone. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data.

