step Burning Blade augur - phoenix bindings (Tailoring)

  zone map 1443

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 52.08,28.86
  goto 52.54,29.98
  goto 52.90,32.33
  goto 53.26,29.86
  goto 54.04,27.86
  goto 54.66,24.64
  goto 54.76,23.48
  goto 55.18,30.05
  goto 55.28,22.40
  goto 55.95,27.40
  kill 4663 optional -- Burning Blade Augur, in the north-center camp
  collect 211247 "Pattern: Phoenix Bindings" optional
  note The Burning Blade Augur is the sole dropper anywhere in the data and spawns only in Desolace; the Tailoring gate follows the cloth-wrist reading (see the inventorys open inference). No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

